WEBVTT

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.550
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.320
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.100
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.830
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.120
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.330
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.270
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.040
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.730
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.510
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.230
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.840
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.490
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.080
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.760
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.370
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.140
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.490
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.800
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.950
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.970
So this is Seiyo Academy.

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.120
I'm definitely going to find it here!

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:51.980
Huh?

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:53.100
Whoa! What?

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.200
Come to my country,

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.640
as its future queen.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.430
Who are you?

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:06.280
Th-That's...

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.060
What you've been looking for.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.310
The Embryo!

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:14.710
Take it, I've brought it to you.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:22.500
The Golden Price! Part Two.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:22.500
Episode 37

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.670
What is it, Shuraiya?

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:33.920
Shuraiya, what are you doing?

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.680
Who are you?

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:42.810
Your owner's completely ensnared by the fake Embryo!

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.120
What? What is the meaning of this?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.660
Be good for me.

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.580
So lame!

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.350
Excuse me.

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.940
Has something happened?

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.590
It's none of your business.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:04.240
Are you feeling unwell?

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.470
Silence!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.000
Shuraiya-sama?

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.520
I see.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:26.020
In that case, I think we can say that the Fake Embryo Plan went well.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:28.800
It was pretty fun!

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.840
An ultra-wealthy prince...

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:35.250
If I can control him, something interesting might happen.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:43.810
The sun will shine brightly on tomorrow's walk!

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:46.850
Are you guys going to be searching for the Embryo again today?

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:49.540
Shuraiya says he'll give us a reward if we find it!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.640
Oh really.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.380
Amu-chi!

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:54.140
Hello!

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:55.250
Over here!

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:56.960
What?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.220
Look, look! It's Shuraiya's father!

00:03:59.220 --> 00:03:59.700
What?

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.830
King Seomila arrived at the United Nations yesterday,

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:06.890
and has just finished meeting with the President of the United States.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:11.780
Shuraiya's dad is impressive! He's super hot! I want his autograph!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:12.790
Is that it?

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:15.220
Amu-chi, ask Shuraiya for me!

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.280
You're the future queen, right?

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.860
No!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.680
Why not, you super-stingy meanie?

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.770
He is just like someone we know.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:26.790
Yeah.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.430
Who could that be-dechu?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.740
Shuraiya-sama?

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.720
Pearl, let me out.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.270
Lamila?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.600
Lamila!

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.780
I can't remember...

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:58.600
What happened last night?

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.630
Oh, there he is!

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.020
Shuraiya, we found you!

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:03.790
Hinamori Amu?

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.630
What's wrong? What are you doing here?

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.570
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.980
You've finally resolved to become my queen!

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:12.740
No!

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:17.740
This is absurd. There is no girl in the world who wouldn't love me.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:18.720
I know!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.400
You're truly a boy, aren't you?

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.560
I'm a girl!

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.350
Never mind, I've got a favor to ask.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.470
It looks like Yaya's become a fan of your dad's.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.470
He really is a cool dad!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.410
Doing great deeds around the world!

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:35.010
He seems very busy.

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:38.020
That's right, Father is very busy.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.510
It's always been that way.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.180
Hey, look! A plane!

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:50.800
The flood damage has become quite extensive.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.070
I must go at once!

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:52.390
Yes, Sire.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.640
Father.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:56.680
Shuraiya.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:06:00.600
Study the geography of the country.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:10.790
Father.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.680
I vow to save you

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.110
from your suffering!

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.810
That's our King Seomila!

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.640
The Great King!

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:43.390
My father is adored throughout the land.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:46.810
They call him the best king in the world; brave, wise, and full of compassion.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:50.160
But to me, he is simply cold and harsh.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:54.340
What humor is there in that?

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:57.220
You actually respect your father, don't you?

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:59.680
You're just stubborn.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.650
You're just not being honest with yourself!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.600
That is true.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:04.770
Do not mock me!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.810
As if I would respect him.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:17.160
Oh! I forgot to ask for the autograph.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.920
That's right...

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.590
I have the Embryo now.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:36.140
There's no need for me to even consider my father any longer.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.190
What's wrong?

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.460
I feel some sort of bad energy!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.390
An X Egg?

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.850
It's like that, but...

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.770
It is slightly different.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:45.720
Let's go!

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:46.520
Yeah.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.100
Ah, Hinamori-sama!

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.100
Pearl!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.970
Lamila!

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.360
What's going on?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.770
Please hang in there!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.770
And Shuraiya's been acting strangely since last night?

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:11.080
Yes.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.270
It's like he's a different person.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:18.370
I'm surprised, though. Pearl can see Guardian Characters, too?

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:24.720
I always thought Lamila was Shuraiya-sama's guardian fairy.

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:28.420
He is so much like King Seomila.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.220
Brave and wise.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.680
Even his compassion.

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:34.020
I see.

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:37.330
Lamila is just like Shuraiya's dad.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.330
The mystery is solved-dechu.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.290
Are you okay?

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.710
Don't worry about me, worry about Shuraiya.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.220
He's being manipulated by an evil power!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:53.870
It's because he received a fake Embryo from a suspicious girl last night.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:55.150
A fake Embryo?

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:57.050
A suspicious girl?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:58.720
It must be Hoshina Utau.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.530
I must save him!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.510
Let us join forces and save Shuraiya.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:09.680
Yes.

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:12.170
That was unusually good-dechu.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.900
He's cool!

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.970
"Unusually" is uncalled for.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.360
I won't lose to someone like Hinamori Amu.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.770
Meeting in progress.  In use.

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.320
The one chosen to be Shuraiya-sama's queen

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:26.680
will be me!

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.950
Excellent, Saya-sama!

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.640
Shuraiya-sama is approaching.

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.190
Very well, Haruka-san.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.770
I'm Mika.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.780
It's Shuraiya-sama!

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.290
What a majestic figure!

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:40.310
He looks so manly!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:42.360
Wild and gorgeous!

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.770
Shuraiya-sama.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.020
I have a few things to discuss with you.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:55.520
I've prepared for you a portrait from France, a snow sculpture made from snow from the North Pole,

00:09:55.520 --> 00:10:00.350
and gold-dusted face cookies from Asakusa.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.870
Worthless.

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:09.250
You are only after the throne of the queen, jewels and parties.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.810
Such girls are tiresome.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.510
You sense it, too?

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:31.430
A sinister presence.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:32.820
Let's go!

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:39.930
Gorgeous! Gorgeous!

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:47.710
Impossible!

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:51.450
Worthless.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:54.930
What is this?

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:57.750
Shuraiya!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:10:59.040
Shuraiya!

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:04.220
Magic Tornado!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.680
Lamila!

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.930
Lamila, answer me!

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:18.330
Now, do it!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.430
We're being sucked in!

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:33.690
Oopsie-daisy.

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.410
Let us out!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.640
Shuraiya!

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:48.350
What are you doing?

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:05.560
I have the Embryo.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:07.430
Open your eyes!

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.530
That's not the Embryo!

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:13.290
I see that it's just compressed X Egg energy.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:13.990
Amu!

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:14.720
Right.

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.160
I'll just Character Transform.

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:18.060
Wait, where are Ran and the others?

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.040
Save us, Amu-chan!

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:21.190
We can't get out!

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:23.460
It is dark and scary!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:25.390
No way! You're all in there?

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.270
Celebrity!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.390
Huh? What is this?

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:37.020
We're trapped!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:42.350
Now there's none left who can oppose me!

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:45.430
I have greatly surpassed my father!

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:47.100
As long as I have the Embryo,

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.770
I don't need Lamila or anything else!

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:50.830
That's not true.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.330
Lamila is who you want to become!

00:12:54.310 --> 00:13:01.240
You act stubborn, but deep in your heart you want to be a great king like your father!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:03.810
That's why Lamila looks just like him!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.720
I want to be

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.030
like my father?

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:11.630
The perfect father; a great king.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:14.810
That's an incredible burden. Don't push me!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:18.220
Don't force me to become a king like my father!

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:21.470
But you love your father, don't you?

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:26.640
Of course! But my father has never considered my feelings!

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:31.450
This is bad! Lamila is going to become an X Character!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.970
Pearl.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:38.350
No, the King isn't like that!

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.430
Is this me?

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.290
This is good.

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:53.590
Being so strict that he begins to detest me is fitting.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.520
He is straightforward and brave.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:00.690
Though he still has many faults,

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:05.030
don't you think my naughty prince shows some promise?

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:05.770
Yes, Sire!

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:10.720
That's a lie! He's never praised me, not once!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:15.260
The King has always kept you in his heart!

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.920
He believes in you.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.270
Pearl!

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:30.310
Shuraiya-sama!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.600
Are you okay?

00:14:57.970 --> 00:14:59.120
Are you...

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.730
Pearl's Guardian Character?

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:01.790
Yes.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.160
My...

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:04.310
Guardian Character?

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:07.520
Yes. Leave this to me.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:12.680
Gorgeous!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.400
There.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:31.640
Impossible!

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:37.810
Now...

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.420
There!

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:46.170
Amu-chan, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.060
Are you okay, Kusukusu?

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:51.150
I'm fine! It was fun!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:52.370
Let's go, Rima!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.310
Yeah.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:55.680
My heart:

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.100
Unlock!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.790
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.020
My heart:

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.430
Unlock!

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:33.630
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:36.520
Let's join them!

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:37.180
Yeah!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:39.040
Character Change!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:41.760
Mashiro-san, get the X Characters!

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:42.600
Okay.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.680
Juggling Party!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.890
Let's gather all the X Eggs in one place!

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:56.390
Roger!

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:56.410
Right.

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:00.670
It's okay.

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:03.770
Let's leave it to the Guardians.

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.630
M-My Embryo!

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:13.640
You're pitiful!

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:16.810
You did everything you wanted with the power of your own will!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:20.180
I thought you were pretty cool when you were strong-willed.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:21.950
But now you're just negative!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.850
What happened to all that self-confidence?

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:28.900
How can you understand my feelings?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.390
The pressure to succeed my father...

00:17:31.390 --> 00:17:35.050
You don't have to become just like your father!

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:39.330
You can become your own king, as you are!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:42.220
As I am...

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.060
You little...

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.930
We have to return everyone to normal.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:55.970
Including Lamila.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:57.670
Amu!

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:59.520
Go! Use Open Heart!

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.810
Negative Heart:

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.730
Lock On!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.060
Open Heart!

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:29.080
Lamila.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:33.990
Shuraiya.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.660
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.350
I went a bit far in what I said.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:44.850
But it'd be nice if you had the courage to not run away from the person you want to be.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:49.060
I-I knew that!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.270
It's just that the expectations everyone had of me made me uncomfortable.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.690
There it is, your stubborn side.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.720
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:00.510
You two are so alike!

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:01.600
How?

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.770
Good grief.

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:12.530
Whatever happened?

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:15.490
I've completely forgotten somehow.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:23.180
Thank you all so very much.

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.440
No problem, it was nothing.

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:27.580
More importantly, Shuraiya,

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:29.820
don't you have something to say to Pearl?

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:30.470
Huh?

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:32.220
What? What is it?

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:34.680
Do you?

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.050
I'm sorry, Pearl,

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.610
for making you worry.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:44.520
Apology accepted.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.390
What's with you guys?

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:51.890
Nothing!

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:54.840
Ginger!

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:56.270
Where were you?

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:58.820
She was playing with me.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.240
Oh, that explains it.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.340
How long have you been there?

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.690
He's always popping up unexpectedly.

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:08.040
He is my father's friend.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.180
Shuraiya,

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.770
I'm giving this to you.

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:15.890
It's a letter your father gave me a long time ago.

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:21.890
I spent two years of my youth at Seiyo Academy.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:29.240
During that time, I thought that if I could find the Embryo, I could use it to make everyone in our country happy.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:35.150
But when I could not find the Embryo, I realized

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:40.380
that it was not the Embryo that would make the people happy.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.360
It was myself, who would one day become their King.

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.520
Everyone,

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:52.100
will you come to the ceremony?

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.050
What?

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:54.640
Ceremony?

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:57.190
I've just made my decision.

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.850
I'll become Crown Prince,

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:03.150
and I want you all to hear my oath.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:05.180
Shuraiya!

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:09.810
I swear

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:14.470
to someday succeed my father and become King.

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:17.680
That's right! I will!

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:19.680
I'll become a king overflowing with bravery!

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:23.340
And I'll make a dragon my servant, and we'll go on adventures!

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.060
What?

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:25.720
Huh?

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.980
He's still saying that?

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:33.800
What a troubled prince.

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:34.720
Prince?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.580
No, uh, um...

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:39.840
One King is enough!

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:42.140
You will become <i>my</i> servant!

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:45.680
Excuse me? <i>You</i> will be the servant here!

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:50.710
This is hopeless.

00:21:56.220 --> 00:22:00.500
After a little while, Shuraiya returned home.

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:04.100
It's pretty peaceful now.

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:06.940
It's really quiet around here.

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:10.400
I wonder what everyone's doing now.

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:11.390
Yeah.

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:13.820
Shuraiya, the naughty prince...

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:16.970
What kind of king will he become?

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:48.800
I am number one today!

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:54.530
Why do you think Amu-chan can Character Transform with me?

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:56.730
It's probably because of the Humpty Lock.

00:23:56.730 --> 00:23:59.650
That lock is very mysterious.

00:23:59.650 --> 00:24:03.680
We don't know much about it. It's full of secrets somehow.

00:24:03.680 --> 00:24:07.020
Right, right! And what about the Dumpty Key that Ikuto has?

00:24:07.020 --> 00:24:09.590
They seem to be connected in some way.

00:24:09.850 --> 00:24:11.180
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:12.970
Key, Lock, He and I!

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:16.320
Oh-ho! There'll be some wonderful scenes!

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:19.520
Like what? Now my heart's pounding.
